# A turn whose bill comes later (deferred-turns.json): the stream names its
# generation and no cost, and the fake gateway answers the first six
# GET /v1/generation?id=<gen> with 404 (not written yet) and the seventh with
# the record. `pending` is the session scope while the bill is being asked
# for; `settled` the same scope once it is known, as shown and after `r`;
# then the 30-day window. `gwlog` keeps every ask; `home` what each product
# kept.
models models.json
gateway deferred-turns.json
wait 2.5
type explain the plan please
key Enter
wait 1.5
type /usage
key Enter
wait 1
key BTab
wait 0.5
snap pending
wait 6
snap settled
key r
wait 1
snap settled-r
key Tab
wait 1.5
snap d30
home end
gwlog
key Escape
